        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sulphate pulp, average, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sulphate pulp, average, at regional storage
na;
Synonyms: kraft pulp, Kraftzellstoff; 
UUID: 0987e0bc-cd71-321c-8dc3-63ce34b66a0a
This module includes the transport of a mix of ECF, TCF and unbleached sulphate pulp from the production site to a central distribution site  within Switzerland.; Geography: Deliveries to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Location:  Deliveries to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total Swiss chemical pulp consumption in 2000: 486.8 kt
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_0987e0bc-cd71-321c-8dc3-63ce34b66a0a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
